Define a structure packaging chart-level geometry for one member:

```lean
structure AtlasBallGrowth (A : OverlapAtlas M d) (μ : Measure (Vec d)) [μ.IsAddHaarMeasure]
    (dist : M → M → ℝ) where
  chartOf : M → ℕ
  ball_subset : ∀ x r, 0 < r → closedBall x r ⊆ A.chart (chartOf x) '' A.source (chartOf x)
  density_le : ℝ
  density_le_spec : ∀ x r, 0 < r → ∀ y ∈ A.chartPreimage (chartOf x) (closedBall x r), A.density (chartOf x) y ≤ density_le
  density_ge : ℝ
  density_ge_pos : 0 < density_ge
  density_ge_spec : ∀ x r, 0 < r → ∀ y ∈ A.chartPreimage (chartOf x) (closedBall x r), density_ge ≤ A.density (chartOf x) y
  chart_doubling : ∀ x r, 0 < r → μ (A.chartPreimage (chartOf x) (closedBall x r)) ≤ chartC * μ (A.chartPreimage (chartOf x) (closedBall x (r/2)))
  chartC : ℝ≥0∞
  -- closedBall measurability
  measurable_closedBall : ∀ x r, MeasurableSet (closedBall x r)
```

