```lean
import Poincare.L4.ManifoldIBP.AtlasMeasureGrowth

namespace Poincare.L4.ManifoldIBP

/-- The conformal chart metric g = ρ² δ. -/
def conformalChartMetric (ρ : Vec d → ℝ) (hρ : ContDiff ℝ ⊤ ρ) (hρpos : ∀ x, 0 < ρ x) : ChartMetric d where
  g := fun x i j => (ρ x)^2 * (if i = j then 1 else 0)
  smooth := by
    intro i j
    -- (ρ ·)^2 * const
    exact (hρ.pow 2).mul contDiff_const  -- or ContDiff.mul
  posDef := fun x => by
    change ((ρ x)^2 • (1 : Matrix (Fin d) (Fin d) ℝ)).PosDef
    exact Matrix.PosDef.smul (pow_pos (hρpos x) 2) Matrix.PosDef.one
```
For smooth: goal `ContDiff ℝ ⊤ (fun x : Vec d => (ρ x)^2 * (if i = j then 1 else 0))`. 
`(hρ.pow 2) : ContDiff ℝ ⊤ (fun x => (ρ x)^2)`. Then `.mul contDiff_const` gives `ContDiff ℝ ⊤ (fun x => (ρ x)^2 * (if i=j then 1 else 0))` if the constant matches. `(hρ.pow 2).mul contDiff_const` — `ContDiff.mul : ContDiff 𝕜 n f → ContDiff 𝕜 n g → ContDiff 𝕜 n (fun x => f x * g x)`. So `(hρ.pow 2).mul contDiff_const` should work. Need `hρ.pow 2` — is it `ContDiff.pow`? `hρ.pow 2 : ContDiff ℝ ⊤ fun x => ρ x ^ 2`. Yes.

For `posDef`: `change ((ρ x)^2 • (1 : Matrix (Fin d) (Fin d) ℝ)).PosDef` — the goal is `(Matrix.of fun i j => (ρ x)^2 * (if i = j then 1 else 0)).PosDef`. Is `Matrix.of (fun i j => c * (1 i j))` defeq to `c • 1`? `(c • M) i j = c * M i j`, and `1 i j = if i = j then 1 else 0`; `Matrix.of` is identity. So `change` should work. If not, use `convert`/`ext`.

